{"id":"2091321275281236477","platform":"x","account":{"username":"Wise1Philosophy"},"published_at":"2026-08-23T00:27:01Z","content":"In 10 years, the world splits into two groups. Economists call it the &quot;K-shaped economy&quot; and the next 2-3 years decide which line you land on. • An overclass using AI to build wealth, automate income, and move at a speed no solo human can match. • An underclass being managed by it. This isn&apos;t a forecast anymore. It&apos;s already underway. Some numbers worth sitting with: • Workers with AI skills earn 56% more than peers in the same role. That gap doubled in one year. • Companies adopting AI are generating 3x the revenue per employee. • 90% of workers haven&apos;t spent a single hour on AI training. • Goldman Sachs projects 300 million jobs touched by AI by 2028. That&apos;s roughly 24 months out. If you haven&apos;t built anything with AI yet, haven&apos;t automated one workflow, haven&apos;t used it to produce income or make yourself harder to replace, you&apos;re on the wrong line right now. That&apos;s not a dig. You can shift your trajectory today. But in six months the gap will be twice as wide. In a year, it may not be crossable. Interested in AI? Follow @AiEvolutio58513 and never fall behind. I track ChatGPT, Claude, and every tool quietly changing how we work and create, then hand you the tested signals. 15 years old. 7 AI agents. 10 projects a day, pulling in $900 a day. This isn’t one kid grinding like a machine; it’s a kid who figured out how to get a small crew working for him all at once. Claude Code writes the code. He gives it a single sentence. Every agent lives inside Op…","url":"https://x.com/AiEvolutio58513/status/2091321275281236477","media":[{"type":"image","source_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQXdnhabcAALEXY.jpg?name=orig","local_path":"assets/images/2026/08/23/2091321275281236477-1.jpg"}],"metadata":{"collected_at":"2026-08-23T05:37:22Z","collector":"hermes"}}
